 ### Splat TBO Upload & Layout
 - **Definition:** Packs per-splat data (center, covariance, DC color/alpha, optional SH) into Texture Buffer Objects (TBOs) for GPU consumption [S1, unofficial].
-- **Step:** Iterate over splats. For each splat, copy `center.xyz` as raw float bits to `d[0..2]`. Pack covariance upper-triangle to `d[3..5]` using `packHalf2x16`: `d[3]=covA[0],covA[1]`; `d[4]=covA[2],covB[0]`; `d[5]=covB[1],covB[2]`. Pack DC color/alpha to `d[6]` using `packDCColor`. Set `d[7]=0`. Create `GL_TEXTURE_BUFFER` buffer with `GL_RGBA32UI` format. Bind to `tbo_tex_`. For non-DC SH coefficients, pack each coefficient's RGB into `RGBA16F` texels (B=0), layout is `[splat0_c1, splat0_c2, …, splat1_c1, splat1_c2, …]`. Create SH TBO with `GL_RGBA16F` format [S1, unofficial].
